{"check":"api_key","fails_when":"no API key resolves at any level of the precedence chain","remediation":"pass --api-key, set the provider env var or TAU_API_KEY, or add api_key/keys.<provider> to config.json — `tau init` scaffolds a starter","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/troubleshooting.md#setup--config-problems--tau-doctor"}
